204
00:21:51,162 --> 00:21:53,702
もっと自由な音楽で
with even freer music,

205
00:21:53,702 --> 00:21:56,602
ほらドライブかけたら止まらないぜ Rock and roll!
and once we hit the drive, there's no stopping! Rock and roll!

