Daisy, that's Bremen next door, but—

208
00:22:03,089 --> 00:22:05,209
よかったら共に参るか？
Would you like to come along if you'd like?

209
00:22:04,409 --> 00:22:07,169
すぐ行こう！一起見してるぜ
Let's go right now! We're checking it out together!

210
00:22:07,649 --> 00:22:11,229
このサウンドが分かるのか？
Can you understand this sound?

211
00:22:11,869 --> 00:22:15,149
おうYes! それじゃあ取り込んでやるぜ
Oh, yes! Then we'll absorb it right in!

212
00:22:15,149 --> 00:22:20,489
ブレーメン Yeah!
Bremen, yeah!

213
00:22:22,955 --> 00:22:26,575
ブレーメンへ行こう　なりたい自分に正直に
Let's go to Bremen, true to the self we want to be,

214
00:22:26,815 --> 00:22:36,595
流れる世界を目指してゆこう　一緒に！
aiming for a flowing world, together!

215
